      * IMELP - Error Log File
      *=========================================================================
     A          R PEL01                     TEXT('Error Log File')

     A            ELTIME          Z         COLHDG('Timestamp')
     A            ELAPP         10          COLHDG('Application')
     A            ELCODE         7          COLHDG('Error Code')
     A            ELDESC        80          COLHDG('Error Description')
     A            ELUSER        10          COLHDG('UserID')
     A            ELPGM         10          COLHDG('Program')
     A            ELADSC        80          COLHDG('Addl Description')

